<title>ITALY: Italian Sept retail sales fell 0.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italian Sept retail sales fell 0.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail sales of medium and large firms in Italy fell 0.1 percent year-on-year in September, national statistics institute Insee said.</p>
<p>It said the retail sales index (1990=100) was 138.7 in September against 138.8 in the same 1995 month.</p>
<p>But retail sales in the first nine months of 1996 rose 5.2 percent compared to the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +392 66129589</p>
